          "description": "Wide horizontal divided bar with English, science, maths and history labels centred inside their segments. A separate horizontal scale below has downward ticks at every integer from 0 to 10, with labels only at 0, 4, 5, 8 and 10 cm. No arrows, grid or legend.",
